# Pyodide runtime assets — regenerated from node_modules/pyodide by the
# "postinstall" script (scripts/copy-pyodide-assets.mjs) on every install,
# so they always match the pinned pyodide version. Not committed: it's ~14MB
# of binary/WASM that git would otherwise keep a full copy of on every bump.
public/pyodide/

